Files vendored from projectbluefin/common
=========================================

The files listed below, under system_files/shared/, originate from
projectbluefin/common (https://github.com/projectbluefin/common), licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE). They were copied byte for
byte from the image this repository used to build from:

  ghcr.io/projectbluefin/common@sha256:fbcef9b1636bc67c2cb58327527f01c9798280229ad5a91c2f8dac0a5d3b6f3c
  built from projectbluefin/common commit 7f273b6aecbd7bdbbdf88ea746c2a2381f5881cc
  with the projectbluefin/branding submodule at 59ca14a42f5a922159895d37935f70e408a42c7d (Apache-2.0)

Files that common generated or downloaded at build time keep their upstream
headers and licenses:
  - usr/lib/udev/rules.d/70-u2f.rules: Yubico libfido2 (BSD-2-Clause, header in file)
  - usr/lib/udev/rules.d/71-*.rules: fabiscafe/game-devices-udev 1.0 (MIT,
    Copyright (c) 2017-2026 Fabian Bornschein)
  - usr/share/bash-completion/completions/ujust, usr/share/zsh/site-functions/_ujust,
    usr/share/fish/vendor_completions.d/ujust.fish: generated with `just --completions`

Not vendored:
  - Wallpapers (usr/share/backgrounds/bluefin, usr/share/gnome-background-properties)
    are still copied at build time from ghcr.io/ublue-os/bluefin-wallpapers-gnome,
    pinned in image-versions.yml.
  - etc/bazaar/bazaar.yaml, etc/bazaar/blocklist.yaml, usr/lib/systemd/user/bazaar.service
    and both 11-bluefin.xml files: this repository already had its own copies,
    which took precedence over common's, so they were kept.

Changed in this repository after vendoring:
  - usr/lib/systemd/user/ublue-user-setup.service: added
    ConditionEnvironment=!XDG_SESSION_CLASS=greeter so it doesn't run in the
    GDM login screen or initial setup session.

