ChairLift (Control Center) files, copied later from projectbluefin/common
commit 8820523227b0329b02b44af4d2d65854d8d214cc (system_files/shared). They are
not part of the image above. All are byte for byte except where noted:

  system_files/shared/usr/bin/brew-preinstall
  system_files/shared/usr/lib/systemd/user-preset/01-brew-preinstall.preset
  system_files/shared/usr/lib/systemd/user/brew-preinstall.service
      (changed: waits for the network with nm-online before each attempt
      and retries after 60 s instead of 30 s)
  system_files/shared/usr/libexec/bootc-update-stage
  system_files/shared/usr/libexec/brew-preinstall
      (changed: removed the --external-chairlift option and the migration of
      ChairLift installs from older taps, which do not apply here, and skips
      accounts that cannot write the Homebrew prefix)
  system_files/shared/usr/share/applications/io.projectbluefin.chairlift.desktop
      (from ChairLift, GPL-3.0, with an absolute Exec= path and a shorter comment)
  system_files/shared/usr/share/icons/hicolor/scalable/apps/io.projectbluefin.chairlift.svg
      (from ChairLift; CC0 1.0, see ChairLift's data/icons/NOTICE)
  system_files/shared/usr/share/icons/hicolor/symbolic/apps/io.projectbluefin.chairlift-symbolic.svg
      (from ChairLift; Project Bluefin artwork, see ChairLift's data/icons/NOTICE)
  system_files/shared/usr/share/polkit-1/actions/io.projectbluefin.chairlift.bootc.policy

usr/share/ublue-os/homebrew/preinstall.d/chairlift.Brewfile (the ublue-os/tap
cask), usr/share/chairlift/config.yml and usr/share/chairlift/channels.yml are
this repository's own. The ChairLift helper, its PolicyKit policy and its GSettings
schemas are downloaded from the ChairLift release at build time (Containerfile).

